// The `Prometheus` custom resource definition (CRD) defines a desired
// [Prometheus](https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus) setup to run in a Kubernetes cluster. It allows
// to specify many options such as the number of replicas, persistent storage, and Alertmanagers where
// firing alerts should be sent and many more.
