// same namespace. The number of StatefulSets is equal to the number of shards which is 1 by default.
//
// The resource defines via label and namespace selectors which `ServiceMonitor`, `PodMonitor`, `Probe`
// and `PrometheusRule` objects should be associated to the deployed Prometheus instances.
